92
00:02:12,050 --> 00:02:13,720
ifies it into a modern, four

93
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,910
layer technical architecture.

94
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:18,030
This hierarchy is absolutely

95
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:19,800
crucial. So at the very bottom,

96
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,440
you have the form layer. These

97
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,610
