which rules to apply and when.

114
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,600
And this parallel is just

115
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,570
perfect. The form layer, that's

116
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:50,480
our ancient cave paintings. The

117
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:52,060
meaning layer is when we came

