00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,600
grammar, our formulas. And the

121
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,310
meta rules layer is our ability

122
00:02:59,310 --> 00:02:59,880
to use

123
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,630
logic and strategy. All PMKR

