00:03:01,630 --> 00:03:03,450
does is make this ancient, time

125
00:03:03,450 --> 00:03:05,230
-tested structure something a

126
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:07,050
computer can understand and use

127
00:03:07,050 --> 00:03:08,520
. So how does this clever

128
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,230
layered model actually solve

129
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:12,120
our duplication crisis? It all

130
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,880
comes down to a really powerful

131
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,690
but simple idea called the save

132
00:03:15,690 --> 00:03:17,830
information principle. And it's

133
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:19,440
exactly what it sounds like.

134
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,240
You store a piece of knowledge

135
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,810
