141
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:33,350
composition. And you know what?

142
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:34,540
If you've ever created a

143
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:35,840
shortcut to a file on your

144
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,670
computer, you basically already

145
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:39,170
