148
00:03:42,220 --> 00:03:43,860
tiny little pointer that says,

149
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:45,230
hey, the real file is over

150
00:03:45,230 --> 00:03:46,970
there. PMKR does the exact same

151
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:48,590
thing, but for every tiny unit

152
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:50,790
of knowledge. Now, let's look

153
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:52,260
at the real world impact. In

154
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,830
the old way, if you have a

155
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:55,280
thousand different rules that

156
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,020
