166
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,020
. I mean, that's not just a

167
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:15,640
small improvement. It's a

168
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,630
complete paradigm shift. And

169
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:19,140
