00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:33,140
really just the beginning. This

178
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:34,740
architecture makes something

179
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:36,350
else possible, something far

180
00:04:36,350 --> 00:04:37,890
more profound for the world of

181
00:04:37,890 --> 00:04:39,830
AI. It's called the dual client

182
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:41,320
